              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezekieli 27:30–34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu aha arira kusononeka sana hata achidzimwagira mitsanga ya vitswa na kuamba, “Shaka rani ro mudzi mkpwulu! Kala ni mudzi ambao wauhenda hosi hurio na meli hukale matajiri kpwa sababu ya utajiriwe. Ela mudzi wosi ukaphya ndani ya dzisaa dzimwenga bahi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
