          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phapho taphandaaka taa tsona. Wala takundakala na sharee za bwana arusi wala bibi arusi, yani takundalólwana tsona bii. Mudzi wa Babeli undahendwa hivi kpwa kukala ahendadzi-bishara himo akala atu akulu na ayi a dunia. Na sababu ya atu hinyo kukala matajiri ni sababu mataifa ganjina gosi gachengbwa ni utsai wa nyo mudzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
