                  "text": "Jeremia 51:49",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumo mudzini mwaonewa milatso ya manabii na atakatifu anjina a Mlungu, phamwenga na milatso ya atu osi arioolagbwa duniani.”",
          "type": "text",
